1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,236
Hi! I've been spending most
of this year on a campaign

2
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:05,000
to stop the destruction
of video games.

3
00:00:05,805 --> 00:00:07,307
The short version
of what's going on

4
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:10,515
is more and more games are
being designed with kill switches.

5
00:00:10,615 --> 00:00:13,547
So you buy a game, then
later the company decides,

6
00:00:13,548 --> 00:00:17,101
"Nah, we're going to disable your
game. And everybody else's copy."

7
00:00:17,298 --> 00:00:19,031
It's planned obsolescence.

8
00:00:19,157 --> 00:00:22,222
Well, we've launched a
European Citizens' Initiative,

9
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:25,458
which would introduce new
law in the EU to stop this.

10
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:28,318
And if we get enough
signatures, one million...

11
00:00:28,318 --> 00:00:30,063
Yeah. I know.

12
00:00:30,064 --> 00:00:32,532
...then there's a real chance
this could pass into law.

13
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:34,968
And we have time
to do it. One year.

14
00:00:34,968 --> 00:00:37,804
Go to stopkillinggames.com.
It'll tell you what to do.

15
00:00:37,804 --> 00:00:40,307
It's only for EU
citizens, I'm afraid,

16
00:00:40,308 --> 00:00:43,443
but we all win if Europeans
could come through on this.

17
00:00:43,444 --> 00:00:47,156
Get everybody you can to sign it.
Friends, family, whoever.

18
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:52,370
Sign this if you don't like having things you
own destroyed, either now or in the future.

19
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:56,080
I don't know how much
more simple I can make this.

20
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:59,326
Yeah, I guess if you like having
things you own taken from you,

21
00:00:59,327 --> 00:01:01,850
don't sign this initiative.
You won't like it.

22
00:01:01,850 --> 00:01:05,882
Yeah, what is it? Peasant mentality?
Is that what that's called?

23
00:01:06,195 --> 00:01:09,267
All right, that's it.
Go to stopkillinggames.com.

